      },
      "figureReview": "Read XML and rendered original: upper rest and lower extended configurations are offset vertically. Positive extension is rightward from the rest reference; red restoring force is leftward. No numerical stiffness, extension or force scale is declared; schematic arrow placement does not prescribe a point measurement. Caption and restoring direction agree.",
